== b35_scopedbox
  san:    exit 0 lab text0-0|lab text1-7|lab text2-14|
  O3:     exit 0 lab text0-0|lab text1-7|lab text2-14|
  interp: exit 0 lab text0-0|lab text1-7|lab text2-14|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/b35_scopedbox.debug.san
--- run san
lab text0-0
lab text1-7
lab text2-14
--- run O3
lab text0-0
lab text1-7
lab text2-14
--- interpret
lab text0-0
lab text1-7
lab text2-14
